# No subagent timers

On background `Task` / subagent (`run_in_background: true`): bookkeep, **end the turn**, resume on the completion notification (or user ping).

Forbidden for subagent waits: `AwaitShell` / sleep / short poll loops on transcripts. Allowed: close monitoring of hang-prone *shell* jobs (dev servers, builds) — not SDD agents.
